{
  "_help": {
    "about": "Monsters. The key is the enemy id used by stages.json. Start an id with _ to disable it. To make a new monster, copy an entry and reuse an existing ai and model with new numbers and a tint.",
    "name": "Shown on boss bars and banners.",
    "ai": "Behaviour: dog (runs at you and lunges), crow (circles and dives, flies), pumpkin (hops and spits seeds), shooter (keeps its distance and fires ranged shots), blob (hops at you; can split when killed), mosquito (buzzes straight at you, flies), ghost (drifts at you through walls, flies), snail (crawls at you, leaving a slime trail that slows you), summoner (keeps far away and summons monsters until killed), frog (leaps at you), cauldron (never moves; spews monsters until destroyed), ritual (stands still, channelling a demon; see stages.json ritual), golem (boss: slams, throws boulders, charges), eye (floats in, keeps its distance and fires hexes), voidling (shambles at you, slow and swaying), crawler (skitters at you low to the ground in zigzag bursts, and now and then slips through the void to come out a few meters closer), tentacle (never moves: slams where you stand and gurgles to stun you, see stages.json gaze), cthulhu (boss: chases you without rest, smashing flurries of tentacles around you).",
    "model": "3D model: dog, crow, pumpkin, alien, blob, mosquito, alienbird, witchdoctor, shaman, ghost, cultist, snail, frog, cauldron, eye, voidling, crawler, tentacle, cthulhu, or for bosses golem, bigblob, deer, orc (the tiki warlord), demon.",
    "hp / damage / speed": "Values at danger stage 1. Stages scale health and damage.",
    "radius": "Collision size at size 1.",
    "size": "Model scale (default 1). Also scales the radius.",
    "xp": "Experience value of the soul crystal it drops.",
    "mass": "How hard it is to knock back and push around.",
    "flying": "Ignores walls and fences.",
    "boss": "Shows a boss bar, cannot be knocked back and pays out rewards on death.",
    "summons": "golem ai: how many times it calls a pack from the caves as its health drops.",
    "deathSound": "die_dog, die_crow, die_pumpkin, die_ghost or die_golem.",
    "debris": "Colors of the bits that fly off when it is hit.",
    "tint": "Optional color multiplied over the model (dog, crow and pumpkin models).",
    "colors": "Boss models only (golem, bigblob, deer, orc, demon): stone, stoneDark, moss and lava. On the blob these are skin, dark skin, furniture and glow; on the deer fur, dark fur, antlers and glow; on the orc skin, dark skin, tiki mask wood and glow; on the demon skin, dark skin, horns and glow.",
    "maxOnScreen": "Draw limit for this monster (default 500). Only monsters within about 46 meters of you are drawn.",
    "ranged": "pumpkin and shooter ai: range, cooldown (seconds), damage and speed of its shots. shooter also: kind (bolt = green alien bolt, hex = purple bolt that poisons you), count (shots per volley) and spread (radians between them).",
    "summon": "summoner and cauldron ai: every = [min, max] seconds between summons, max = most of its summons alive at once, weights = enemy ids it summons with relative chances, rare = ids from weights that come out as rare monsters with modifiers.",
    "trail": "snail ai: every (seconds between slime puddles), life (seconds a puddle lasts) and radius. Slime slows you.",
    "plate": "true = always shows its name and a health bar over it (cultists, cauldrons, ritual witch doctors).",
    "inflicts": "Optional statuses its hits put on you, with a chance each, e.g. {\"slow\": 0.25}: slow, shock, stun, root, or the damage over time poison and bleed (status_effects.json playerDots). See status_effects.json.",
    "rewards": "Boss loot. items: list of drops with minRarity (0-2: Common, Magic, Rare), luck and optional minRank (only from the Nth scheduled boss onward). fish, catnip, rerolls: counts. title and subtitle: the banner. A boss drops its experience (xp) like any monster, split over a few crystals; bosses never give blessings (only experience barrels and finished dungeons give free levels).",
    "elite": "Multipliers for elite monsters (glowing gold, rare spawns). essence multiplies the essence they drop.",
    "drops": "Chance per kill for normal and elite monsters. itemLuck is extra luck on the item roll. itemMult multiplies every item drop: the item chance per kill, and the chance of each item in boss and invasion rewards (0.25 = 75% fewer items).",
    "essence": "Essence it drops when killed (the workbench currency). Elites, rare monsters and invaders multiply it.",
    "split": "Optional: {\"into\": enemy id, \"count\": n} monsters that burst out of it when it dies.",
    "abilities": "Optional boss abilities, each with its own timer. anchor: a circle drops at your feet and you must stand in it for 'time' seconds in a row before 'window' runs out, or it explodes on you for 'damage' x the boss's hit damage (default time 2, window 15, radius 5, damage 4; gap 60 = at most one circle a minute from all monsters together). tesla: 'towers' tesla towers rise around the farm; stand within 'radius' of each one for 'charge' seconds to charge it. Charge them all within 'time' seconds and they strike the boss for 'reward' x its max health each and stun it; otherwise every uncharged tower strikes you for 'damage' x the boss's hit damage (default towers 3, charge 2.5, time 16, radius 3.2, damage 2.5, reward 0.08). every = [min, max] seconds between uses.",
    "boulderAcid": "golem ai: its thrown boulders leave a pool of acid that burns you."
  },
